---

<MainLayout
  title="The Debug Agent | BlueRobin"
  description="An autonomous, graph-grounded LLM agent for root-cause analysis: a FalkorDB world-model, correlation-first blame propagation, an externalized verification gate, and bi-temporal incident memory — research-grade RCA at homelab cost."
>
  <!-- All-projects backlink -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-6">
    <a href="/" class="text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-neural-400 transition-colors">← All projects</a>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden" style="background: var(--gradient-mesh-light);">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-96 h-96 bg-complement-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-pulse"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-40 -left-40 w-96 h-96 bg-neural-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-pulse" style="animation-delay: 1s;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 sm:py-28">
      <div class="text-center animate-entry">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-8" style="background: var(--color-complement-alpha-10); border: 1px solid var(--color-complement-alpha-30); color: var(--color-complement-300);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
          Research project &middot; The Debug Agent &middot; Autonomous RCA
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-display font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-tight tracking-tight">
          <span class="title-warm">An agent that finds<br>the root cause</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10">
          When production breaks, an LLM agent investigates — grounded in a FalkorDB world-model, disciplined by hard evidence, and honest about what it does not know. It only opens a pull request when the evidence supports it. Research-grade RCA at a €50/month homelab budget.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-14">
          <a href="#papers" class="btn-primary">Read the papers</a>
          <a href="#pipeline" class="btn-secondary">How it works</a>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-sm">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-complement-400"></span>
            Graph-grounded
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
